        "source_url": "https://www.economy-ni.gov.uk/articles/electricity-consumption-and-renewable-generation-statistics",
        "methodology": "Gross final electricity consumption includes metered and own-use renewable and non-renewable generation plus imports minus exports, gross of system losses; renewable numerator is indigenous renewable generation. Revised GFEC basis, not the superseded pre-2026 consumption measure.",
        "revision_policy": "Statistics in Development; rounded estimates and earlier periods may be revised, including own-use estimates and supplier corrections; not final.",
        "rounding": "Publisher-rounded whole percentage point",
        "edition": "fixed_2026-09-03",
